In this PR we implemented validator RPC methods to retrieve validator status. This is useful when a validator wants to find out what he/she is suppose to do before retrieving assignments


The validator statuses are defined as:
```
//	PENDING_ACTIVE - validator is waiting to get activated.
//	ACTIVE - validator is active.
